{"product_id":"good-morning-gorillas-magic-tree-house-26","title":"Good Morning, Gorillas (Magic Tree House #26)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe #1 bestselling chapter book series of all time celebrates 25 years with new covers and a new, easy-to-use numbering system!Gentle giants or giant monsters? That's the question Jack and Annie have about gorillas when the Magic Tree House sweeps them to the mountains of Africa. There they meet a group of amazing and sometimes frightening mountain gorillas. Annie knows how to play with the creatures right away. But Jack is left out. Will the gorillas be able to teach him some special magic?Did you know that there’s a Magic Tree House book for every kid?Magic Tree House: Adventures with Jack and Annie, perfect for readers who are just beginning chapter booksMerlin Missions: More challenging adventures for the experienced readerSuper Edition: A longer and more dangerous adventureFact Trackers: Nonfiction companions to your favorite Magic Tree House adventures\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 193\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mary Pope Osborne\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780375806148\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898400170137,"sku":"17RE-2-9780375806148","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/91xHgMo6ZNL._AC_UF1000_1000_QL80_9a4a5623-faed-471b-a2b1-b09f22af70b4.jpg?v=1763204851","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/good-morning-gorillas-magic-tree-house-26","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}